              "racialMovementMarkdown": "- Reduced movement penalty from heavy terrain  \n- Stable footing in harsh environments  \n- Slightly reduced agility in tight/confined spaces  \n\n---\n\n### ✅ Bonuses\n- Extremely high durability  \n- Strong melee presence  \n- Excellent survival in extreme climates  \n- Natural tank/protector role  \n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ Drawbacks\n- Reduced agility and finesse  \n- Larger size makes stealth difficult  \n- Slower reaction speed compared to lighter races  \n\n\n> \"Strength is not in striking first… it is in standing last.\"\n— Elder Tharvak of the Northern Ice",
