              "racialFeaturesMarkdown": "- Height Range:\n  - Male: 5'10\" - 6'5\" (155cm to 198cm)\n  - Female: 5'6\" - 6'1\" (170cm to 185cm)\n\n- Weight Range:\n  - 55 kg to 90 kg \n\n- Skin:\n  - Smooth aquatic skin adapted to abyssal depths\n  - Colour Range:\n    - Midnight Blue\n    - Deep Black\n    - Dark Indigo\n    - Abyssal Violet\n    - Black-Grey\n\n- Hair:\n  - Often appears to drift as though underwater\n  - Colour Range:\n    - Black\n    - Dark Blue\n    - Silver\n    - Deep Purple\n\n- Eyes:\n  - Large reflective eyes adapted for darkness\n  - Colour Range:\n    - Glowing Blue\n    - Silver\n    - White\n    - Violet\n    - Bioluminescent Cyan\n\n- Hands:\n  - Long fingers with slightly elongated joints  \n  - Slight webbing between digits\n  - Slight claw-like nails\n  - Slightly colder to the touch\n\n- Face:\n  - Sharper, more angular features\n  - Expressions often muted or difficult to read\n  - Subtle shadowing beneath the eyes \n\n- Ears:\n  - Elongated and thin, fin-like but more rigid\n\n- Markings:\n  - Faint natural bioluminescent patterns beneath the skin\n\n- Body:\n  - Lean athletic build\n  - Movement is smooth but unnatural—too controlled \n  - Exceptional swimming musculature\n\n---",
