              "racialTraitsMarkdown": "### Frost Sense\n\n#### Description\nFrostborn can feel changes in temperature, ice formations, snowfall, and cold mana currents around them.\n\n#### Gameplay Effect\n- Gain +2 Perception in snowy, icy, or cold environments.\n- Can sense approaching blizzards and severe weather several hours in advance.\n- Detect nearby sources of ice magic within 18 metres.\n- Gain advantage on Survival checks in frozen environments.\n\n---\n\n### Heart of Winter\n\n#### Description\nThe essence of eternal winter flows through every Frostborn.\n\n#### Gameplay Effect\n- Resistant to Cold damage.\n- Immune to natural environmental cold.\n- Ignore penalties from snow, ice, and freezing temperatures.\n- Ice and Frost spells cost 10% less Mana.\n\n---\n\n### Frozen Resolve\n\n#### Description\nLike ancient glaciers, Frostborn possess patience and resilience beyond most mortal races.\n\n#### Gameplay Effect\n- Gain +2 on rolls against Fear effects.\n- Gain +2 on rolls against environmental exhaustion caused by cold climates.\n- Recover Stamina 25% faster while in cold environments.\n- Gain advantage against effects that force panic or emotional manipulation.\n\n---\n\n### Breath of the Glacier\n\n#### Description\nThe body of a Frostborn is naturally adapted to survive beneath frozen waters.\n\n#### Gameplay Effect\n- Can breathe underwater indefinitely.\n- Ignore underwater combat penalties.\n- Swimming speed is doubled.\n- Can safely swim in freezing waters without harm.\n\n---",
