              "racialCharacteristicsMarkdown": "| Characteristic | Buff/Debuff | Stat Rolls | Characteristics Tier Cap |\n| -------------- | ----------- | ---------- | ------------------------ |\n| Strength       | 0           | 4d6        | Tier 3                   |\n| Dexterity      | -2          | 3d6        | Tier 4                   |\n| Agility        | +1          | 3d6        | Tier 5                   |\n| Constitution   | 0           | 4d6        | Tier 4                   |\n| Endurance      | +1          | 4d6        | Tier 4                   |\n| Intelligence   | 0           | 4d6        | Tier 4                   |\n| Wisdom         | +1          | 4d6        | Tier 5                   |\n| Charisma       | +1          | 4d6        | Tier 5                   |\n| Luck           | 0           | 3d6        | Tier 5                   |\n\n---",
              "racialTraitsMarkdown": "### Tide Sense\n\n#### Description\nTideborn possess an innate awareness of the ocean's movements. They can feel shifts in currents, tides, and nearby bodies of water as naturally as breathing.\n\n#### Gameplay Effect\n- Gain +2 Perception while within 30 metres of a natural body of water.\n- Can determine the direction of nearby coastlines and large bodies of water.\n- Gain advantage on Navigation checks while travelling at sea.\n- Can sense incoming tidal changes several hours in advance.\n\n---\n\n### Child of the Ocean\n\n#### Description\nThe blessing of the Ocean Spirits flows strongly through Tideborn bloodlines.\n\n#### Gameplay Effect\n- Water spells cost 10% less Mana.\n- Gain +1 to Water spell rolls.\n- Resistant to Cold damage.\n- Gain advantage on checks involving ocean survival and navigation.\n\n---\n\n### Ocean's Grace\n\n#### Description\nTideborn move through water with effortless elegance, as though carried by unseen currents.\n\n#### Gameplay Effect\n- Swim speed is doubled.\n- Ignore difficult terrain while underwater.\n- Gain advantage on Agility checks while swimming.\n- Suffer no penalties from rough seas or strong currents.\n\n---\n\n### Breath of the Sea\n\n#### Description\nThe ocean accepts the Tideborn as one of its own.\n\n#### Gameplay Effect\n- Can breathe underwater indefinitely.\n- Ignore underwater combat penalties.\n- Cannot drown through natural means.\n- Gain +2 Endurance while submerged.\n\n---",
